{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2660", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2660/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2660/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2660/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2660", "id": 3445534928, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s7NXrDQ", "number": 2660, "title": "MavlinkDirect doesn't support STATUSTEXT with newlines", "user": {"login": "Bercon", "id": 2254354, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTQzNTQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2254354?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bercon", "html_url": "https://github.com/Bercon", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bercon/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bercon/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bercon/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bercon/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bercon/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bercon/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bercon/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bercon/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Bercon/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 3, "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:28:36Z", "updated_at": "2025-12-14T22:56:02Z", "closed_at": "2025-12-14T22:56:02Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Using v3.10.2. Trying to deserialize the `fields_json` in `mavsdk::MavlinkDirect::MavlinkMessage` with nlohmann::json fails when the message has newlines.\n\nIf the message_id != 0, the debug log also seems to start accumulating the messages. Sending same \"hello\\nworld\" repatedly, on 6th messages repeats it 6 times:\n```\nJSON error: [05:24:05|Debug] MAVLink: alert: hello\nworldhello\nworldhello\nworldhello\nworldhello\nworldhello\nworld (system_impl.cpp:349)\n[json.exception.parse_error.101] parse error at line 2, column 0: syntax error while parsing value - invalid string: control character U+000A (LF) must be escaped to \\u000A or \\n; last read: '\"hello<U+000A>' on message.fields_json: {\"message_id\":253,\"message_name\":\"STATUSTEXT\",\"chunk_seq\":1,\"id\":10000,\"severity\":1,\"text\":\"hello\nworld\"}\n```", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2660/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2660/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3325670024", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2660#issuecomment-3325670024", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2660", "id": 3325670024, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7GObKI", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-09-23T21:54:18Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-23T21:54:18Z", "body": "You need to tell your json library to ignore special characters like in this case tab `\\t`. PX4 sends statustext with `\\t` at the end for messages that are also sent out via the events system.\n\nAnd for statustext, you might want to use telemetry::status_text which allows to re-assemble multiple messages, or alternatively you can use the new events system.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3325670024/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3544758758", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2660#issuecomment-3544758758", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2660", "id": 3544758758, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7TSLnm", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:33:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-18T02:33:37Z", "body": "@Bercon I now also see the repeating issue. Do you mind sharing a small example for me to reproduce this?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3544758758/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, 